                <pb facs="0745" n="657" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg657"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pearson to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-03-13"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>American Missionary Labaree was murdered near Urumia, Persia, 9th instant. Motive
                    apparently robbery. Government, at my request, has ordered search for criminal
                    and prompt punishment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pearson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
